title: Leadership table
new-page: true
is-hand: true
max-cards: 3
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.deckDescription =
    Q.left_in_government
        ? "Party, government and foreign affairs"
        : "Party affairs, opposition negotiations and foreign affairs";
Q.handDescription = "Cards in hand";
if (Q.advisor_action_timer <= 0) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription =
        "Leadership bureau — an advisor intervention is available.";
} else if (Q.advisor_action_timer == 1) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription =
        "Leadership bureau — next advisor intervention in 1 month.";
} else {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription =
        "Leadership bureau — next advisor intervention in " +
        Q.advisor_action_timer + " months.";
}
if (Q.leadership_reshuffle_timer <= 0) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription += " A bureau reshuffle is available.";
} else {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription += " Next reshuffle in " +
        Q.leadership_reshuffle_timer + " months.";
}
const hubHand =
    (this.state.currentHands &&
        this.state.currentHands["poland_hub"]) || [];
const hubMonthKey = Number(Q.year) * 100 + Number(Q.month);
Q.poland_hand_count = hubHand.length;
Q.poland_hand_full = hubHand.length >= 3 ? 1 : 0;
Q.poland_discard_used_this_month =
    Number(Q.poland_discard_month_key) == hubMonthKey ? 1 : 0;
Q.poland_discard_available =
    hubHand.length > 0 &&
    !Q.poland_discard_used_this_month &&
    Number(Q.resources) >= 1
        ? 1
        : 0;
Q.pinnedCardsDescription +=
    " End month is always available; passing without an agenda action counts as neglect.";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — the leadership table

**[+ news_headline +]**

**Government:** [+ government_name +], led by **[+ prime_minister +]**.  
**President:** [+ president_name +].  
**Lewica:** [+ left_role +].

<span class="party party-lewica"><b>[+ left_party_name +]</b></span> has **[+ resources +]
party resources**. Annual income: **[+ party_income +]**.
Membership dues provide **[+ member_dues +]**; the **[+
seat_subvention +]** subvention follows **[+ seat_subvention_seats +]** seats
won at the last Sejm election. [? if emergency_fundraising_timer > 0:
Emergency appeals are locked for **[+ emergency_fundraising_timer +]
months**.?]

[? if left_in_government: The governing settlement has
**[+ budget +] budget capacity** under **[+ budget_authority +]**. ?]

[? if not left_in_government and government_has_confidence and not caretaker_government:
**Government negotiation:** leverage **[+ negotiation_leverage +]/100** ·
crisis pressure **[+ national_crisis_pressure +]/100** · cabinet hostility
**[+ government_negotiation_hostility +]/100**. [+ negotiation_forecast +]. ?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and government_party = "pis":
**Hostile cohabitation:** [+ pis_cohabitation_state +] (internal stress
[+ pis_cohabitation_stress +] · defensive rally [+ pis_cohabitation_rally +]).
?]

**Foreign line:** [+ eu_campaign_stage +] · EU influence **[+
eu_influence +]/100** · Washington: **[+ us_president +]** ([+
us_administration +]) · external pressure **[+ foreign_pressure +]/100**.

Draw up to three cards. Playing one turns the month. Discarding costs **1 party
resource**, does not turn the month, and is available only once per calendar
month. Choice subtitles state the direct cost, test or main political exchange
before you commit.

[? if poland_hand_count = 0: **Your hand is empty.** Draw from an available
deck; the discard file has nothing to remove.?]
[? if poland_hand_full = 1: **Your hand is full (3/3).** Play a held card,
use this month's paid discard, or end the month before drawing again.?]
[? if poland_hand_count > 0 and poland_discard_used_this_month = 1:
**This month's discard has already been used.** It reopens after the calendar
advances.?]
[? if poland_hand_count > 0 and poland_discard_used_this_month = 0 and
resources < 1: **The party cannot afford a discard.** Play a card or end the
month.?]

- @poland_party_deck
- @poland_government_deck
- @poland_negotiation_deck
- @poland_foreign_deck
- #poland_advisor
- @poland_manage_advisors
- @poland_discard_card
- @end_month
- @dossier

@end_month
title: End month
subtitle: Pass without playing an agenda card. Neglect carries a political cost.
is-pinned-card: true
view-if: started = 1
card-image: img/poland/cards/end-month.webp
go-to: poland_advance

@dossier
title: Polish dossier
subtitle: Rules, factions and institutions.
is-pinned-card: true
is-special: true
view-if: started = 1
card-image: img/poland/cards/polish-dossier.webp
go-to: library
